{"id":"1e3a52bbd8d60c7a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-atomic.md","title":"Atomic Formula","display":"df-atomic — Atomic Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-atomic","aliases":["58-df-atomic"],"display":"df-atomic — Atomic Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-atomic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-atomic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic — Atomic Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (first-order signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (set of atomic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atomic}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Atomic}_\\Sigma\\)</span> (atomic-formula predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Atomic}_\\Sigma(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Atomic}_\\Sigma(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The dependency already constructs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> using the signature's actual arity map; this file only introduces its predicate presentation.</li>\n<li>Atomic formulas are either equality atoms or applications of relation symbols to arity-matching tuples of terms.</li>\n<li>Boolean combinations of atomic formulas give all first-order formulas.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (first-order signature, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (set of atomic $\\Sigma$-formulas, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Atomic}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Atomic}_\\Sigma(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false}],"bytes":1033,"backlinks":[{"id":"8d0dd5022d216cd1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ}$, $\\mathrm{Atomic}_\\Sigma$, $\\mathrm{Fml}_S$, and $\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S$ are as in [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]], [[../batch07/58-df-atomic.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]], and [[../batch15/58-df-parameters.md]]."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-atomic]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-atomic.md|58-df-atomic]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093"]}